  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\u2022 <b>Dakuten ( \u309B / Tenten ):</b> Adds two small strokes to K,
    S, T, H rows to voice consonants into G, Z, D, B.\n  <i>Example:</i> \u304B (ka)
    \u2192 \u304C (ga), \u3055 (sa) \u2192 \u3056 (za), \u306F (ha) \u2192 \u3070
    (ba)\n\n\u2022 <b>Handakuten ( \u309C / Maru ):</b> Adds a small circle to the
    H row to change it into P sounds.\n  <i>Example:</i> \u306F (ha) \u2192 \u3071
    (pa), \u3072 (hi) \u2192 \u3074 (pi), \u307B (ho) \u2192 \u307D (po)\n\n\u2022
    <b>Sokuon ( \u3063 / Small Tsu ):</b> Creates a slight pause (glottal stop) doubling
    the following consonant.\n  <i>Example:</i> \u304D\u3063\u3066 (kitte = stamp),
    \u304C\u3063\u3053\u3046 (gakkou = school)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ecb0e04f190389a45ae56e33ccd90b69, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9057271998271519067, guid: ecb0e04f190389a45ae56e33ccd90b69, type: 2}
